  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Focus HEX Ultra is an explosive, crisp and highly responsive hexagonal co-polyester designed for advanced players who want strong spin, minimal string movement and exceptional tension stability. Its six-sided geometry and strong snapback generate high spin potential, while a special coating reduces unwanted string movement. Innovative additives help maintain tension over extended play. The string has received strong independent testing results for overall performance, tension stability and value, and has been used as the reference string for German tennisMAGAZIN racquet tests since 2017.",

    "zh": "MSV Focus HEX Ultra 是一款强调爆发、清脆反馈和快速响应的六边形共聚酯球线，专为追求高旋转、低线床位移和优秀保磅能力的高级球员设计。六边形结构与强 Snap-back 提供出色旋转潜力，特殊涂层能够减少球线移动，而创新添加剂则强化长期保磅表现。该产品在多项第三方测试中获得非常高的综合评价、保磅评价和性价比评价，并自 2017 年起成为德国 tennisMAGAZIN 球拍测试的标准参考球线。"
  },

